# Vendor stack foundations

Use this rule set together with the **horizon-frontend-foundations** plugin skills (synced from `synced-vendor-skills/` via `npx skills update`).

- Prefer framework-native patterns from the project’s Next.js and React versions.
- Follow deployment and edge/runtime guidance that matches the project’s Vercel (or host) setup.
- Keep client-only code out of server-only modules; respect the repo’s existing app directory layout.

Add client-specific rules only in that project’s `.cursor/rules` (or equivalent), not in this shared bundle.
